":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おお","ts":"1633005368.102600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P58jW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7e8e1f4-4767-43fc-b5c1-37808c014aad","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/01/06/210452\u003e\nコミットにもメモが残せるらしい :hee:","ts":"1633005327.101700","attachments":[{"fallback":"アジャイルSEの憂鬱: git-notesでコミットにメモをつける - アジャイルSEの憂鬱","id":1,"title":"git-notesでコミットにメモをつける - アジャイルSEの憂鬱","title_link":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/01/06/210452","text":"2020年に「コミットログは良くならない」というのを悟ったので、現実的な解決案である「git-notesでメモを残す」について記事を書いておきます。 前回の記事 \u003chttp://sinsoku.hatenablog.com|sinsoku.hatenablog.com\u003e git-notes 詳細は git notes --help を読んでください。 概要は以下の通りです。 コミットログとは別にメモを残せる コミットはそのままなのでshaは変わらない shaが変わらないのでCIの再実行が起きない 他人のコミットにメモをつけられる 他人に作業を依頼する必要がない メモもリモートにプッシュできる 過去のコミットにメモを残せる 使い方 メモを書く git not…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/13208692334729909605/26006613674963616/1609934692","blocks":null,"ts":1609934692,"service_name":"アジャイルSEの憂鬱","service_icon":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/01/06/210452","original_url":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/01/06/210452"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+bKx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55c49b56-5cd9-4f53-b1b4-2c22edc21688","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/09/17/113633\u003e","ts":"1633005136.101300","attachments":[{"fallback":"アジャイルSEの憂鬱: Git のブランチには説明をつけることができる - アジャイルSEの憂鬱","id":1,"title":"Git のブランチには説明をつけることができる - アジャイルSEの憂鬱","title_link":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/09/17/113633","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/13208692334729909605/8599973812298782137/1505615793","blocks":null,"ts":1505615793,"service_name":"アジャイルSEの憂鬱","service_icon":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/09/17/113633","original_url":"https://sinsoku.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/09/17/113633"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EFncP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbfb7ad8-0c33-4850-a08a-02100ecc0c6c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まだぜんぜん使ってないけど、showのためのalias持ってきてたんだった\n```\tinfo = \"!f () {\\\n\t\tbranch=$(git current-branch);\\\n\t\tif [ \\\"${#}\\\" -eq 0 ]; then\\\n\t\t\tgit config         branch.${branch}.description 2\u0026gt; /dev/null || echo \\\"not description yet\\\";\\\n\t\telse\\\n\t\t\tif [ \\\"${#}\\\" -eq 1 ] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; [ \\\"${*}\\\" == \\\"\\\" ]; then\\\n\t\t\t\tgit config --local --unset branch.${branch}.description;\\\n\t\t\telse\\\n\t\t\t\tgit config --local         branch.${branch}.description \\\"${*}\\\";\\\n\t\t\tfi;\\\n\t\tfi;\\\n\t};f\"```\nそっか、やっぱそうですよねえ","ts":"1633005059.101100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KVX3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0afbe6a3-9b2d-4fb7-b387-c83ac577be6f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"リモート無理っぽい。editできる割りにshowする機能もなさそう。\n\u0026gt; Unfortunately, you can't push descriptions since they're stored in your config, making it useless for the sake of documenting branches in a team.\n\u003chttps://stackoverflow.com/a/8858853/12901910\u003e","ts":"1633004478.099000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Stack Overflow: Branch descriptions in Git","id":1,"title":"Branch descriptions in Git","title_link":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/8858853/12901910","text":"Is there a way in Git to have a 'description' for branches? While I try to use descriptive names, working for a while on a single branch sometimes dampens my memory of why I made some of the other...","thumb_url":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon@2.png?v=73d79a89bded","blocks":null,"service_name":"Stack Overflow","service_icon":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=c78bd457575a","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/8858853/12901910","original_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/8858853/12901910"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lr6aV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ae0dd9a-6214-4043-8967-010c8c749c5c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"リモートに入るのかな?","ts":"1633004273.098200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ts+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"881d6d07-22ef-4717-853a-f80dd79e8044","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そっちだったか、まあそれです。","ts":"1633004258.097900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oPK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4da08f66-738b-4808-9e7e-f396db8f1844","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"```git branch --edit-description```\nっぽい？","ts":"1633004233.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=96"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d04af53-5f9c-40f4-a341-294aefdd288d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ、あとgit-annotationだっけ?ブランチにメモれる機能もあるので、そっちという手もなくはないけど(ただ量の問題あるか)","ts":"1633004004.097200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NGIr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DBD5E838-37EF-45CE-9D56-871EEA5219B0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"最後に todo コミットするのいいな\n\u003chttps://onk.hatenablog.jp/entry/2021/09/30/015113|https://onk.hatenablog.jp/entry/2021/09/30/015113\u003e","ts":"1633003288.096400","attachments":[{"fallback":"id:onk のはてなブログ: branch を寝かせるときは TODO.txt を置いて